                        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
                            <li><code>cards get</code> defaults to <code>structure</code> detail.</li>
                            <li>Baseline edges are <code>call</code>, <code>import</code>, and <code>config</code>.</li>
                            <li><code>graph-slices get</code> defaults: depth 2, both directions, 30 cards, 200 edges, 4000 estimated tokens.</li>
                            <li><code>graph-history</code> defaults: 5 commits, threshold 0.6, 3 alternates, <code>max_duplicates</code> 8.</li>
